{"hash_algorithm":"sha256","ts":"2026-11-01T11:02:51.594Z","author":"harness:claude-code","author_source":"detected","agent_harness":"claude-code","agent_model":"claude-opus-5-5","agent_model_source":"probe","agent_instance":"489489c9e2938b0738fed20a","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"claude-opus-5-5","source":"probe"},"effort":{"value":"xhigh","source":"environment"},"role":{"value":"implementer","source":"inferred","confidence":"medium","rule_version":"v2","evidence":["claim:pm-4zpq71","claim:pm-gh1647","lineage:pm-4zpq71","lineage:pm-o2kc","lineage:pm-doxj"]},"topic":{"value":"workset:pm-4zpq71+pm-gh1647","source":"inferred","confidence":"medium","rule_version":"v2","evidence":["claim:pm-4zpq71","claim:pm-gh1647","lineage:pm-4zpq71","lineage:pm-o2kc","lineage:pm-doxj"]},"version":{"value":"2.1.316","source":"probe"}},"op":"comment_add","patch":[{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-11-01T11:02:51.594Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/comments","value":[{"created_at":"2026-11-01T11:02:51.594Z","author":"harness:claude-code","text":"Implementation: a default fallback returned for an unreadable settings.json (warnings settings_read_invalid_schema, settings_read_fs_error, settings_read_merge_failed) now carries a non-enumerable fallback-origin marker. cloneSettingsReadResult copies it, so cached reads keep it. writeSettings without a persist snapshot checks the marker. Under the workspace-history lock it applies only the delta from the canonical defaults to the caller's proposal onto the stored document it re-reads. The result is validated. If it is still invalid, the write refuses with settings_write_invalid_existing_schema (exit 2): context.field names the first invalid dotted path, original_code is the read warning, and nothing is written and no history is appended. If it validates, it is written with every unrelated stored key kept, including extension-owned sections. The settings validator now reports the failing path: Failure carries path segments through vObject, vArray and vRecordOf, and validateSettings returns { success: false, path }. Chosen behaviour: AC option 2 (preserve and change only the requested key) combined with option 1's refusal when the result would stay invalid. pm config project set context.next_ranking_policy weighted can therefore repair the file, while an unrelated set refuses with the field to fix. Tests: tests/unit/core/store/settings-fallback-write.spec.ts, 10 cases including the CLI regression. All 195 store tests pass.\n"}]}],"before_hash":"b1b4d0db9451a75513daa28b5cf377ffcaa486f3e5a90515d10fb590ca16c1d6","after_hash":"b9bad4d7318131b8d55ba80b85a2b5d872c1ae1b1105c2390dec83be5b2d9e3b","item_hash_version":3,"context":{"agent_provenance_outcomes":{"model":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"claude_session_file","rule_version":"v1"},"version":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"claude_session_file","rule_version":"v1"}}},"event_class":"substantive","record_hash_version":1,"record_hash":"b28ea96fff1aef74a0f22cb2a2374df53880b3a731d35a85693a9b2e2c0c26fe"}
